      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2021,
      "text": "Abraham was a model of excellence[75], devoted to Allah and inclined to true faith, and he was not one of those who associate partners with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 120,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2022,
      "text": "He was grateful for His favors; He chose him and guided him to a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 121,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2023,
      "text": "We gave him good in this world, and in the Hereafter, he will surely be among the righteous[76].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 122,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2024,
      "text": "Then We revealed to you [O Prophet] to follow the religion of Abraham, inclining to true faith[77], and he was not one of those who associate partners with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 123,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2025,
      "text": "The Sabbath was only ordained for those who differed about it[78]. Your Lord will surely judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 124,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2026,
      "text": "Call to the way of your Lord with wisdom[79] and goodly exhortation[80], and reason with them in the best manner[81]. Your Lord knows best who has strayed from His way and knows best those who are rightly guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 125,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2027,
      "text": "If you retaliate, let your retaliation be the like of what you suffered. But if you bear with patience, it is surely best for those who are steadfast.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 126,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2028,
      "text": "And be patient, for your patience comes only from Allah; do not grieve over them[82], nor be distressed by their evil plots.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 127,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 281,
      "ruku": 239,
      "hizbQuarter": 112,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2029,
      "text": "Indeed, Allah is with those who fear Him and those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
